               <title>Inactive Ingredients</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>purified water, petrolatum, isopropyl palmitate, octyl stearate, glyceryl stearate, cetearyl glucoside, dimethicone, PEG-100 stearate, hydroxyethyl acrylate/sodium acryloyldimethyl tautrate copolymer, polyisobutene, PEG-7 trimethylolpropane coconut ether, sodium hyaluronate, tocopheryl acetate, ployether-1, citric acid, oleth-3 phosphate, phenoxyethanol, butylene glycol, iodopropynyl butylcarbamate, triethoxycaprylylsilane</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20181024"/>
            </section>
